{"server":"tw","storyId":"act19side_level_act19side_07_end","groupId":"act19side","stageId":"act19side_07","title":"瘋狂的信號","storyCode":"DV-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"10a2563911a9631b0e89f37c56ca4c377cc71ead687dea8a3c871e0d0a811e85","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在萊茵總部，博士與塞雷婭找到了失聯多日的總轄。\n分別多年後，曾經的老友終於重逢。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，這不是繆爾賽思主任嗎？這麼晚了您還來公司啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......咳咳，是啊，有工作沒幹完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您可真是辛苦啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩位是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們的重要合作夥伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒認出這位嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我看不清臉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"這位可是源石理論學者、礦石病專家、天災研究者，大名鼎鼎的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是您啊！真是難得的機會，竟然讓我碰到了像您這麼厲害的科學家！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（他根本沒聽說過我吧？）","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"（這都能糊弄過去？）","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我們有急事需要儘快上樓——有機會的話，下回一起開午餐會啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。那就不耽誤您的時間了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，我剛才就覺得您很眼熟，您難道不是那位防......防......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......防護材料領域非常有名的專家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕爾維斯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕爾維斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾年萊茵的擴張速度很快，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕爾維斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新來的小朋友們還需要多長長見識啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......兩位主任同時出現？我、我......我還有工作沒做完！我先走啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕爾維斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不準備告訴他們我回來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕爾維斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請原諒我的老花眼，我以前認識您嗎，美麗的瓦伊凡女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕爾維斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼事情的話，我就先回去了。太晚休息可不利於我這把年紀的人的身體健康。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕爾維斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，繆爾賽思主任，別忘了你答應我的黑豆茶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......他真的是路過嗎，塞雷婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是凌晨四點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕爾維斯平常的下班時間是九個小時以前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"果然......直到最後一刻到來前，他都不會輕易把賭注壓在斐爾迪南和克麗斯騰之間的任意一方身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"他還想看看誰的贏面大呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"就算萊茵生命變成了廢墟，他也一定是能活下來的那個吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們進了萊茵總部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領航小隊，準備攔截。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別著急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過你和塞雷婭交手，對你的裝備很感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"方便借我看一眼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在戰鬥之前，你們是這麼打招呼的嗎，羅德島的精英幹員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要誤解，剛才那句話，我不是以羅德島精英幹員的身份說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為一名機械師，我尊重任何優秀的技術及技術的發明者——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，在我奪下你那根形制特別的法杖之前，我想先詢問一下你的意願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你很有趣，Mechanist先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前只是想去見一見塞雷婭，但你和你的上司......那位博士給了我更大的驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也調查過我，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌握儘量多的資訊，是我們這類人在動手之前的習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......萊茵總部的資料庫裡有你的名字，霍爾海雅女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不相信斐爾迪南會雇傭一名歷史學家來追殺自己的同僚。就算是在充滿不可能的哥倫比亞學界，這也太荒誕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是我的副業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的副業是研究歷史？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是一名歷史學者，我在這裡，只是為了見證一則流傳千年的預言成真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同樣的，我也相信，未來的走向能揭示一些被掩埋的歷史——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你們一樣，都是真相的追尋者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g2_edgeofbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道怎麼去找你的混蛋上司嗎，研究員小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他應該在監控室裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轉角的地方有個通風口，要是能爬上去的話，就能用最快的速度抵達監控室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動作要快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，很快就有很多人來迎接我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......警長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道你會站到對面去。你的意志還是不夠堅定，你忘不了你和這名罪犯的過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他還不是罪犯，小子，能定罪的人從來不是你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在走一條不歸路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？你們明明都那麼優秀，為什麼要自毀前程？為什麼......她也不聽我的勸阻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真正想提問的對象並不是我，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也可以替她再教你一回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我們知道自己戰鬥是為了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了守護某些人......守護某些準則不被像那個混蛋主任那樣的人踐踏，我們從來不會猶豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不會像你一樣......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"落腳之前總是先看好陣營——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動手之前還要問為什麼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們找到方向了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那快走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有弩，你沒有。所以先別管我了，管好你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼不跟上去？你一路走到這裡，不也是為了找那傢伙算帳嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也有武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們很久沒有並肩作戰了，瑪麗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼並肩作戰......那時候只是玩遊戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，哪一次遊戲不是我帶你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的很想念......很想念那段時光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"只要從前面的電梯上去，就能直達總轄辦公室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走後面的秘密頻道會是更保險的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道啊，可我們不是在趕時間嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"直接走的話肯定更快，要應對的武裝人員也能更少些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，別走到前面那個位置——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我忘了，那裡是監控區......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們要轉備用計畫了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發現入侵者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住這幾個入侵——等等，主任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，雷吉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎麼回來了......不，您已經沒有權限，不能再往前走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面對入侵者，展露出內心的猶豫只會給敵人機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我再教你一遍該怎麼做嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......舉盾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暈眩器準備，瞄準入侵者——塞雷婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勉強算你合格。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最新一批資料都記錄好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意無人機的方位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要讓實驗體的行動影響到第一手資料的採集。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放心，老闆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要的第一手資料已經自己走到你面前來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很高興......你沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在你手下工作了那麼多年，閱讀你的微表情也變成了工作的一部分——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的左側眉毛輕微地上挑了一下。你明明很驚訝，老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你總是能給我很多驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你回來了，我終於可以好好鬆口氣——那些蠢笨的新人需要像你這麼優秀的研究員好好調教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想讓我當組長？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是組長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到桌上那把鑰匙了嗎？收下它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經完全證明了自己的能力。你不再需要給任何人——無論是我還是多蘿西——當助手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一個項目，你會是第一負責人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這把鑰匙就是我為你準備好的禮物。那是一間嶄新的......空間充裕的實驗室，屬於你的實驗室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你想做什麼研究，我和萊茵生命都會全力支援你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太棒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是還考慮過讓我接任能量科主任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是沒有這種可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你看起來並不驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為無論你給我的未來規劃了什麼道路......我的答案都是“不”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......放下你的法杖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在害怕什麼？你怕我背叛你，在這個你即將迎來重大成功的關鍵時刻，讓你沒法看到自己的光輝未來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我真的會考慮這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白。我明明給了你那麼多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在你身上看到了天賦、勤勉和野心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些都是取得成功的必要品質，也正是這些品質鑄就了我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你真如你所言的那樣器重我的話——你就應該把整個實驗的真相都告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，你會無視那些受試者的安危，你會把我當成監視多蘿西的工具，等沒用的時候，就讓我連同你罪惡的證據一起灰飛煙滅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在你眼中，我是不是一個特別聽話的傻子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利維亞明明提醒過我，我卻直到你動手的最後一刻才醒悟過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還沒有準備好，埃琳娜，我怕你會動搖，就跟現在這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從來沒有信任過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不相信任何人。斐爾迪南，你只信你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我憑什麼要再信任你......相信你的這些許諾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒有給過任何人那麼多機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜，你知道嗎？你比我的孩子更像我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在你身上傾注了那麼多心血，即使此刻，只要你願意，我依然允許你回到我身邊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_i08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就當我求你最後一件事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴吧，老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帶著你的“禮物”和這些虛情假意，離我遠一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我，埃琳娜·烏比卡，從今天開始，不再是在你手下任你擺佈的傻助手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南·克魯尼，你被我開除了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......斐爾迪南主任！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我抓住她，抓住這個暴徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主任，您沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要......再用這種......看起來很關心我的眼神......看著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這讓我覺得......噁心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說我不理解你，可你也並沒有真正理解我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許......在剛才那一刹那，我是有過猶豫和擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那並不是我擔心你給我搗亂，而是我在擔心你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是......真的不想看著你走到這一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這句話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......我也想原樣送給你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......怎麼辦，防衛科的人越來越多了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南還真是做足了準備，塞雷婭再能打，也很難一下子打退這麼多人吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"還得麻煩你幫忙了，繆爾賽思主任。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"......我？不行的，我並不會打架啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"光是跑來跑去躲避他們的攻擊，我就已經很費勁了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒聽到我呼呼喘氣嗎，博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你剛才就很巧妙地幫了塞雷婭一把，不是嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"只要你不再故意拖時間就行。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你發現了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"塞雷婭很久沒回萊茵總部，但還記得哪裡是監控區。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你總是有意無意干擾塞雷婭的視線。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"自從聽到我猜測總轄就在這裡，你明顯不再著急。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我......哎呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"......差一點就真的中招了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......你竟然還拉著我？你......你還願意拉著我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"明明猜到我可能有其他想法......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有什麼想法都是你的自由。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我並不在乎你究竟是什麼立場。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我請你幫助塞雷婭。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是為了羅德島和萊茵生命的共同利益。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這是為了哥倫比亞與其他國家的安全考慮。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"這也是為了你。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"......算上這次，你已經救了我兩回了，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"就當作是報答好了，至少這一回，我會站在你們身邊，幫助塞雷婭去她想去的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"聽到我的呼喚了嗎，水分子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"親吻眼前的每一位生靈，捲走腳下的所有塵埃吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......精靈動搖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是可憐的生靈......她總是希望自己能從其他人口中得到一些關於明天的允諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰又會甘願承認自己與自己所屬的族群只屬於過去呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克麗斯騰沒法給她的東西，那位Dr.{@nickname}難道可以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，塞雷婭已經突破了封鎖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓她見見自己的老朋友吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有其他工作要完成......只能下一次再與這位機械師先生交流了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——要是他能從這批動力甲手中活下來的話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有多久沒有回來了？\n一千四百九十七天。\n分別的時候，或許已是敵人。\n再見的時候，又還是朋友嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g10_senioroffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你回來了，塞雷婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你好，克麗斯騰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_249_muesys","aliases":["繆爾賽思"]}]}
